            "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle is coming soon! Early Access is a chance for players to give feedback to the developer and have your voice heard leading up to the release of the game. Wishlist the game to get notified once available!</p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle is an arcade drift racer that is easy to learn and hard to master, putting you up against a series of challenges to unlock new tracks and cars that can be played across multiple modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle's physics were built from scratch for drifting that feels amazing and is grounded in realism while still being accessible and unique, letting you focus on shaving every fraction of a second off your times and fighting for every position you gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/8fea745f5eaebaa4688d6040a9b65b49.poster.avif?t=1791440521\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/8fea745f5eaebaa4688d6040a9b65b49.webm?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/8fea745f5eaebaa4688d6040a9b65b49.mp4?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your way through multiple variations of stunning tracks, challenging yourself with a slew of events across a diverse set of modes in cars that each have their own characteristics and driving feel. Take yourself back to a simpler time with easy pick-up-and-play ability while retaining a deep progression and challenges to keep you entertained for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We miss the days when racing games were all about the driving feel and a challenging experience, and that's why we're making Slip Angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everyone drifts all the time, it's impossible to drive straight!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It doesn't matter if you win by an inch or a mile if you don't do it sideways.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;60% of the time, I'm drifting ALL the time.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/82ac997e75efc1597222e648e9694da4.poster.avif?t=1791440521\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/82ac997e75efc1597222e648e9694da4.webm?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/82ac997e75efc1597222e648e9694da4.mp4?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving physics that are both simple to learn and rewarding to master. Perfect your speed, angle, and line to earn the highest tier rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and customize a variety of vehicles with their own unique characteristics and driving styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your way through scenic courses with multiple layouts and configurations including race tracks, mountain roads, and streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes keep you on your toes by challenging different aspects of your driving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression through challenging events unlocks new tracks and cars you can use in multiple modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to challenge the world? Try to top the leaderboards for each track and mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, against the AI, or show your friends who's the best!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle is an arcade drift racer that is easy to learn and hard to master, putting you up against a series of challenges to unlock new tracks and cars that can be played across multiple modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slip Angle's physics were built from scratch for drifting that feels amazing and is grounded in realism while still being accessible and unique, letting you focus on shaving every fraction of a second off your times and fighting for every position you gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/8fea745f5eaebaa4688d6040a9b65b49.poster.avif?t=1791440521\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/8fea745f5eaebaa4688d6040a9b65b49.webm?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/8fea745f5eaebaa4688d6040a9b65b49.mp4?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your way through multiple variations of stunning tracks, challenging yourself with a slew of events across a diverse set of modes in cars that each have their own characteristics and driving feel. Take yourself back to a simpler time with easy pick-up-and-play ability while retaining a deep progression and challenges to keep you entertained for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We miss the days when racing games were all about the driving feel and a challenging experience, and that's why we're making Slip Angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everyone drifts all the time, it's impossible to drive straight!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;It doesn't matter if you win by an inch or a mile if you don't do it sideways.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;60% of the time, I'm drifting ALL the time.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/82ac997e75efc1597222e648e9694da4.poster.avif?t=1791440521\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/82ac997e75efc1597222e648e9694da4.webm?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/521180/extras/82ac997e75efc1597222e648e9694da4.mp4?t=1791440521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving physics that are both simple to learn and rewarding to master. Perfect your speed, angle, and line to earn the highest tier rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and customize a variety of vehicles with their own unique characteristics and driving styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide your way through scenic courses with multiple layouts and configurations including race tracks, mountain roads, and streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes keep you on your toes by challenging different aspects of your driving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression through challenging events unlocks new tracks and cars you can use in multiple modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to challenge the world? Try to top the leaderboards for each track and mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, against the AI, or show your friends who's the best!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "Arcade drift racing where being sideways is almost mandatory! Find the perfect balance between speed and angle to clear objectives and slide your way through multiple game modes - enjoy the drift flow state or challenge yourself to be one of the best, the choice is yours.",
